      "message": "So umm... I know this jus moved up here, but what is this used for? This header now provides a few `sknonstd` and `SkCount`, and I don\u0027t see any mention of them? I guess we\u0027re not currently building headers, so IWYU wasn\u0027t actually run on this to state that it should be removed. But until we\u0027re running IWYU on headers by themselves it seems weird to be making further changes (like the export) since things will just be further confused. For instance, does removing this break other files which do need to include it?",
